      'from.australia.eyebrow': 'Mailing from Australia',
      'from.australia.h1': 'Send mail to Canada from Australia',
      'from.australia.lede': 'In Australia and need to mail something to Canada? Skip the international postage search. Write your letter online, and we\'ll print it and post it from inside Canada, within one business day.',
      'from.australia.who.h2': 'Who uses Letterhome from Australia',
