      'from.bangladesh.faq.q1': 'Can I send Bengali-language documents?',
      'from.bangladesh.faq.q2': 'How long does delivery take?',
      'from.bangladesh.faq.q3': 'Can I send IRCC immigration documents from Bangladesh?',
      'from.bangladesh.faq.a0': 'Yes. We accept international Visa and Mastercard through Stripe. No Canadian account needed.',
      'from.bangladesh.faq.a1': 'Yes. Bengali characters in standard PDF format print correctly. We print exactly what you upload.',
      'from.bangladesh.faq.a2': 'We mail within one business day of payment. Canada Post delivers within Canada in up to 2 weeks after that.',
      'from.bangladesh.faq.a3': 'Yes. Many applicants from Bangladesh use Letterhome to send immigration paperwork to Canadian offices. Just upload your PDFs and enter the mailing address.',
      'from.bangladesh.postage.p1': 'Sending a standard letter from Bangladesh to Canada via Bangladesh Post costs approximately <strong>৳60–120</strong> (roughly US$0.55–1.10). International airmail to Canada typically takes <strong>2–4 weeks</strong> with limited tracking. Courier services like DHL cost significantly more.',
      'from.bangladesh.postage.p2': 'With Letterhome, your letter is printed and mailed from <em>inside</em> Canada for <strong>$10 CAD</strong> (approximately ৳1,350). It travels as domestic Canadian lettermail with no international routing, typically arriving within Canada in up to 2 weeks.',
      'from.bangladesh.cta.btn': 'Send a letter from Bangladesh &rarr;',
      'from.brazil.eyebrow': 'Mailing from Brazil',
      'from.brazil.h1': 'Send mail to Canada from Brazil',
      'from.brazil.lede': 'Need to mail a letter or document to Canada from Brazil? We handle the printing, the Canadian postage, and the trip to the post office, so you don\'t have to.',
      'from.brazil.who.h2': 'Who uses Letterhome from Brazil',
      'from.brazil.postage.h2': 'Postage from Brazil to Canada in 2026',
